Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: qdsp6v2: Z500KL: a loader for the ADSP

Nothing starts the ADSP on this kernel: /sys/kernel/boot_adsp/boot, which init
writes, comes from adsp-loader, part of the audio techpack that is not here yet.
The sensors live on the ADSP, so sensors.qcom gave up waiting for its SMGR service,
init killed the sensors HAL, and SensorService aborted system_server about 90
seconds after every start of Android.

files/drivers/soc/qcom/qdsp6v2/adsp-loader.c is this tree's cdsp-loader.c for the
ADSP: same sysfs file, same subsystem_get. The full loader replaces it with audio.
---
--- drivers/soc/qcom/qdsp6v2/Makefile
+++ drivers/soc/qcom/qdsp6v2/Makefile
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_MSM_CDSP_LOADER) += cdsp-loader.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_MACH_ASUS_Z500KL) += adsp-loader.o
